# Money tab model inputs. Hand-maintained. Values here are only the starting point:
# once the site is seeded, values edited under Money > Model inputs are kept on re-seed.
# status: assumed | reported (one player) | measured (clan tested) | game (robrun.info game data) | unknown | setup (your choice)
# Anything assumed, reported or unknown marks its business provisional on the Money tab.
